    },
    {
      question: 'Which 7 catalog models belong to the FidgetSupply Acoustic Tuning Fork Series?',
      answer: 'Our 7 acoustic models are FS-150 (Compact 20-Magnet N45 PTFE Tuning Fork Slider), FS-129 (Divine-Realm Dual-Bearing Tuning Fork EDC), FS-148 (304 Stainless Resonance Chamber Spinner), FS-107/112 (Acoustic Chime Gourd), FS-086 (Harmonic Rhythm Stainless Slider), FS-091 (56-Magnet Abalone Stainless Slider), and FS-045 (Wood-Tone Cavity Slider).'
